ial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">최대 약 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">325</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">취업진로상담 교과목 수료, 멘토장학금 지급(총 50만원, 1월 일괄 지급예정)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청 방법</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">붙임파일(</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">멘</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">토 신청서) 작성 후 kshu0802</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">@kumoh.ac.kr로 메일 제출</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size